        <div id="short-answer" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2>The Short Answer</h2>
<p>
            <strong>A Peloton Tread Vision, assembled and used with the membership, costs about
            $4,245 in the first year, about $5,445 over three years and about $6,644 over five,
            before tax.</strong> The folding Tread Flex comes to about $3,995 over three years if you
            assemble it yourself, and the Tread+ Vision to about $8,794. The membership is the
            part people underestimate: at $49.99 a month it adds about $600 a year, which over five
            years is close to the price of the Tread Flex itself.
          </p>
          <p>
            If you want Peloton’s instructors, the cost is the cost, and spreading it over the
            years you will use the machine is the fairest way to judge it. If what you want is a
            good treadmill with incline and some guided workouts, a machine such as the Horizon 7.0
            AT, at $1,099 on Amazon and listed as compatible with the Peloton App, does most of the
            job for well under half the three-year cost.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div id="total-cost" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2>Total Cost of a Peloton Tread Over 1, 3 and 5 Years</h2>
<p>
            The table adds the hardware price Peloton showed on 9 November 2026, the expert assembly
            fee where it is required or likely, and the All-Access Membership at $49.99 a month. It
            assumes you pay cash, keep the membership for the whole period and do not resell the
            machine.
          </p>
          <div class="not-prose overflow-x-auto my-8"><table class="min-w-[560px] w-full text-sm border-collapse">
            <thead><tr>
              <th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Item</th>
              <th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Tread Flex</th>
              <th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Tread Vision</th>
              <th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Tread+ Vision</th>
            </tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Hardware (from)</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$2,195</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$3,495</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$6,695</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Assembly</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Self-assembly assumed</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$150 expert assembly</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$299, required</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Year one, with membership</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">about $2,795</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">about $4,245</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">about $7,594</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Three years</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">about $3,995</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">about $5,445</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">about $8,794</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Five years</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">about $5,194</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">about $6,644</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">about $9,993</td></tr>
